{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "summary",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Select",
            "id": "api_set_select",
            "props": {
              "param": "api_set",
              "default": "generic",
              "valueField": "id",
              "labelField": "label",
              "label": "API set"
            },
            "data": {
              "dataset": "api_sets_list"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "summary_kpistrip",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Open URL",
                  "field": "open_url_steps",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "external_apis",
                      "params": {
                        "step_name": "Open URL"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Insert from URL",
                  "field": "insert_url_steps",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "external_apis",
                      "params": {
                        "step_name": "Insert from URL"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Import Records",
                  "field": "import_records_steps",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "external_apis",
                      "params": {
                        "step_name": "Import Records"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "MBS / Plugin",
                  "field": "mbs_plugin_hits",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "external_apis",
                      "params": {
                        "ref_type": "Plugin"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Web Viewer",
                  "field": "web_viewer_hits",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "external_apis",
                      "params": {
                        "context": "Web Viewer"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Calculations",
                  "field": "calc_step_hits",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "external_apis",
                      "params": {
                        "source_type": "Script (Calc Step)"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Distinct URLs",
                  "field": "distinct_urls",
                  "format": "number"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "api_families",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "API families"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "api_families"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "api_families_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "api_family",
              "density": "comfortable",
              "sortable": true,
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "api_family",
                  "label": "Family"
                },
                {
                  "field": "hits",
                  "label": "Hits",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "hosts",
                  "label": "Hosts",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "urls",
                  "label": "URLs",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "files",
                  "label": "Files",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "script_step",
                  "label": "Script Step",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "count"
                },
                {
                  "field": "plugin",
                  "label": "Plugin",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "count"
                },
                {
                  "field": "layout_object",
                  "label": "Layout Object",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "count"
                },
                {
                  "field": "field",
                  "label": "Field",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "count"
                },
                {
                  "field": "custom_function",
                  "label": "Custom Function",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "count"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openDashboard",
                "args": {
                  "id": "external_apis",
                  "params": {
                    "api_family": "{{api_family}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "url_details",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "URL details",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "url_details"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "FilterChips",
            "id": "url_comment_filter",
            "props": {
              "param": "comment",
              "default": "exclude",
              "resetParams": [
                "page"
              ],
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "all",
                  "label": "All",
                  "countField": "count_total"
                },
                {
                  "value": "exclude",
                  "label": "Without comments",
                  "countField": "count_without"
                },
                {
                  "value": "only",
                  "label": "Only comments",
                  "countField": "count_comments"
                }
              ]
            },
            "data": {
              "dataset": "url_comment_counts"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "url_details_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "url",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "pageParam": "page",
              "searchParam": "q",
              "sortParam": "sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "api_family",
                  "label": "Family",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "ref_type",
                  "label": "Ref type",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "host",
                  "label": "Host"
                },
                {
                  "field": "name",
                  "label": "Script/Context"
                },
                {
                  "field": "file",
                  "label": "File"
                },
                {
                  "field": "context",
                  "label": "Step/Type"
                },
                {
                  "field": "step_index",
                  "label": "#",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "url",
                  "label": "URL"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{target_uuid}}",
                  "type": "{{target_type}}",
                  "file": "{{file}}",
                  "params": {
                    "step": "{{step_uuid}}",
                    "types": "{{layout_filter_types}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "url_hosts",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Consolidated URLs (by domain / IP)",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "url_hosts"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "url_hosts_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "host",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "pageParam": "hosts_page",
              "searchParam": "hosts_q",
              "sortParam": "hosts_sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "host",
                  "label": "Domain / IP"
                },
                {
                  "field": "api_family",
                  "label": "Family",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "usages",
                  "label": "Usages",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "files",
                  "label": "Files",
                  "align": "right"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openDashboard",
                "args": {
                  "id": "external_apis",
                  "params": {
                    "host": "{{host}}",
                    "comment": "{{comment}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Markdown",
        "id": "markdown",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "content": "## Notes\n\nThis dashboard is a **generic template** intended for reuse in other FileMaker projects. The API-family classification is driven by a selectable **API set**: `generic` is the built-in default (typical cloud / SaaS / communication / AI providers). Install project-specific sets under `.fmlab/dashboards/api-sets/` — see `api-sets/README.md`.\n\n- **API set**: the dropdown at the top switches the url → family classification (`generic` plus any installed sets). It re-classifies the family table, the detail list and the host roll-up.\n- **KPIs as filters** (across every API family): *Open URL*, *Insert from URL* count script steps of that type with a URL in the step text. *Import Records* counts **every** Import-Records step regardless of source (file / URL / variable) — as an interface indicator. *MBS / Plugin* counts URLs in calculations using MBS / CURL / Files calls. *Web Viewer* counts Web Viewer sources from layouts. *Calculations* counts script-step formulas (Set Variable, Set Field, If …). *Distinct URLs* is a pure statistics tile without filtering.\n- **API-families table**: clicking a family row filters the detail list. Clicking *All* clears the filter. The *Script Step*, *Plugin*, *Layout Object*, *Field*, *Custom Function* columns show how a family's URLs are distributed across reference types; zero values are hidden.\n- **Ref type**: `Plugin` overrides the container type when the calculation text calls MBS or plugin functions (`CURL.*`, `MBS(…)`, `Files.*`, `Plugin.*`).\n- **Sources**: `Script (URL Step)` = `Open URL` / `Insert from URL`. `Script (Import)` = every `Import Records`. `Script (Calc Step)` = steps with a URL in the formula expression. `Custom Function` = URL in the CF body. `Field` = Calculated or AutoEnter formula. `Layout Object` = Hide / Tooltip / Label / Trigger param or Web Viewer source.\n- **Secret masking**: query parameters `api_key`, `token`, `password`, `secret`, `auth`, `signature` are reduced to `[masked]` in the URL column.\n- **Comment filter**: the chips above the URL details toggle *All* / *Without comments* / *Only comments*. URLs found inside `/* */` or `//` comment blocks are hidden by default (false positives in inactive code); the counts are family-scoped.\n- **Consolidated hosts**: the lower table rolls the URLs up per root domain / IP (with port, no path) with a usage count, and honours the active filters (family, comment, KPI selection). Click a host to drill the URL details down to it.\n- **Navigation**: clicking a detail row opens the matching object (Script + step anchor, Custom Function, Field, Layout — for Web Viewer with the additional layout filter `Container,Web Viewer`).\n- **Sorting**: column headings in API families, URL details and the consolidated host list are clickable (▲▼)."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
